# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
# Explicitly ignore dynamically built Go binaries and extension-less executables
/graphql
/protocol
go/*
!go/*/
!go/*.*

go/cmd/*/*
!go/cmd/*/*/
!go/cmd/*/*.*

bin/*
!bin/*.sh

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
vendor/
go/vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum
# NATS
streams.json


# env file
.env
.claude
**/env
.logs
.go_cache
**/go_cache
**/logs
**/keys
**/db_data
**/redis_data
container/postgres/db_data
**/pki/bin
**/pki/ca-server/
**/pki/bootstrap-client

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/
.aider*
